> What tricks can be used to actually survive the room.  

Go down stay on the staircase, go back up to rest (since a few monsters 
follow you, maybe write the E-word on the down staircase).
If swarmed by monsters, teleport/dig down, repeat with the downstairs, 
or go up and dig down to land somewhere else.
Carry fortune cookies for cats/dogs.
Beware of pyrolisks. Remember that they can't hurt you if you don't see 
them.
Beware of wands, remember the fixed firing angle, make use of skilled 
cone of cold/firebolt if applicable.
Keep track of your mana supply.
Try to get those monsters lining up behind you.
Be fast (wands of speed can help. Don't be burdened).
If you are no friend of running, just wait it out in your instant fort 
(scroll of earth+E-word).

